# RedeTI Recovery OS: never commit live device credentials or customer data.
# These patterns are defense-in-depth; review all staged files before commit.
**/REDETI/authorized_keys
**/REDETI/ts-authkey
**/authorized_keys
**/ts-authkey
**/*_ed25519
**/*_ed25519.pub
**/*.ppk
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/tailscaled.state
**/tailscale.state
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/customer-data/
**/client-disks/
**/*.qcow2
**/*.vmdk
